      "text": "Before we released the rack, we ran &gt;1B tokens through it for a 8xTP model as a final test. Our first gen product is deterministic - every single one of those &gt;1B tokens matched exactly (ULP 0 for the final layer output). Now for the next quadrillion tokens!",
